IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. HELPER-TEST.

*> 這份檢查器不需要修改，是這一題的驗收標準。

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  CK-NUMV     PIC S9(7)V99.
01  CK-99       PIC 99.
01  CK-S5       PIC S9(5).
01  CK-X12      PIC X(12).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
COBLINGS-TEST-MAIN.
    PERFORM PARSE-NUMBER
    MOVE WS-NUM TO CK-NUMV
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "PARSE-NUMBER：'  0012.50  ' 應轉成 12.50"
              BY CONTENT 12.50
              BY CONTENT CK-NUMV

    PERFORM CLEAN-TEXT
    MOVE WS-LEN TO CK-99
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "CLEAN-TEXT：'coblings' 的長度"
              BY CONTENT 8
              BY CONTENT CK-99
    MOVE WS-CLEAN TO CK-X12
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "CLEAN-TEXT：TRIM 後轉大寫"
              BY CONTENT "COBLINGS    "
              BY CONTENT CK-X12

    PERFORM MATH-HELPERS
    MOVE WS-REM TO CK-99
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "MATH-HELPERS：17 MOD 5"
              BY CONTENT 2
              BY CONTENT CK-99
    MOVE WS-BIG TO CK-S5
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "MATH-HELPERS：MAX(10, 42, 7)"
              BY CONTENT 42
              BY CONTENT CK-S5
    MOVE WS-SMALL TO CK-S5
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "MATH-HELPERS：MIN(10, 42, 7)"
              BY CONTENT 7
              BY CONTENT CK-S5

    CALL "COBLINGS-DONE"
    GOBACK.
